# ============================================================
# WHITELIST: mac dinh BO QUA tat ca, chi track thu can len GitHub
#   -> code moi (bsc_*.py), notebook ket qua, report, config, test
# Moi artifact (data, checkpoint, ray DB, ket qua chay) song tren Drive:
#   /content/drive/MyDrive/bsc/
# ============================================================
*

# --- Code loi cua Stage 1 ---
!bsc_*.py
!configs/
!configs/**
!tests/
!tests/**

# --- Splits DA GHIM (§2.2): nho, phai versioned, immutable ---
!splits/
!splits/*.json

# --- Notebook moi (Stage 1) ---
!notebooks/
!notebooks/**

# --- Report / ke hoach ---
!*.md
!.gitignore

# --- Notebook cu: chi giu source, output nang da bi strip ---
!convert_*.ipynb
!merge_s*.ipynb

# --- Luon loai, ke ca khi khop rule tren ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
*.zip
*.pth
*.pt
*.npz
*.npy
*.nii
*.nii.gz
*.mat
*.h5
*.html
*.docx

# Secrets: token lay tu Colab Secrets (userdata.get), khong bao gio hardcode
.env
*.secret
secrets.json
credentials.json
